WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
I have a nut allergy.
Can you help me with the menu?

2
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.960
Hello, I'm Mathieu, the cook. I'll
prepare a Périgord menu, without nuts.

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.560
Is the sauce safe for me?

4
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:19.040
Yes. I cook the sauce separately,
and I check every ingredient.

5
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.040
Your plate will be safe,
and full of flavour.
